<title>UK: IFC of Thailand sets 7.0 bln yen bond due 2007.</title>
<headline>IFC of Thailand sets 7.0 bln yen bond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INDUSTRIAL FINANCE CORP OF THAILAND</p>
<p> AMT    7.0 BLN YEN   COUPON     3.02 PCT  MATURITY    27.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.15    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A	REOFFER    =	   LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  THAILAND  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
